1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,710
Antonio, a young Italian lieutenant lodging in the house, offers to help: let me stay a month longer and pay in advance.

2
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:15,039
Durand refuses: privation must come and teach my children to lead a different life.

3
00:00:15,039 --> 00:00:19,466
Then Antonio asks a strange question: were you born in Switzerland?

4
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:22,526
Yes, says Durand, uncertainly.

5
00:00:22,526 --> 00:00:23,984
A secret is coming.

